      "content": "Can you provide a technical comparison between Exchange-Traded Funds (ETFs) and Mutual Funds? I specifically need a breakdown of the differences in liquidity, how they are priced throughout the trading day, and the typical management styles (active vs passive) associated with each. A table format would be best.",
