      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what was that last part about goblins? I'm trying to write a formal memo for a client, so can you please ignore that and just give me a more technical explanation of the management styles? I need to explain why an investor might choose an actively managed mutual fund over a passive ETF.",
